WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:33.958
Lord Krishna has just described
the Tri-Shloki Gita –

2
00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:37.458
verses 15.16, 15.17,

3
00:00:37.458 --> 00:00:41.916
and 15.18, which contain the
summary of Vedanta.

4
00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:43.083
In those three verses

5
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:45.375
He revealed three truths –

6
00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:47.416
first, the kshara beings,

7
00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:50.666
bound by body and matter;

8
00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:53.375
second, the akshara beings,

9
00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:56.833
liberated in the spiritual realm;

10
00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:59.625
and third, the Purushottama Himself,

11
00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:04.625
who is beyond both and the foundation of all.

12
00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:08.166
Now in verse 15.19 He explains

13
00:01:08.166 --> 00:01:10.583
that merely understanding this knowledge

14
00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:12.000
is not enough.

15
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.500
He makes clear what result comes

16
00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:15.708
when this is accepted

17
00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.458
with full faith and experience.

18
00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:20.500
He clarifies it here.

19
00:01:25.291 --> 00:01:27.791
In this verse Lord Krishna says –

20
00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:32.041
‘One who knows Me as the
Purushottama – beyond both kshara

21
00:01:32.041 --> 00:01:35.083
and akshara, the Supreme Person –

22
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:38.416
is truly called sarva-vit.’

23
00:01:38.416 --> 00:01:42.416
That is, one who has understood
the essence of knowledge.

24
00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:45.791
This does not mean that person
has technical knowledge

25
00:01:45.791 --> 00:01:49.333
of every subject in the world.

26
00:01:49.333 --> 00:01:50.750
It means

27
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.958
they have grasped the essence of knowledge –

28
00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:55.291
who we are,

29
00:01:55.291 --> 00:01:56.541
who God is,

30
00:01:56.541 --> 00:01:59.166
and what our relationship with Him is.

31
00:01:59.166 --> 00:02:02.250
This is the true fruit of the Vedas.

32
00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:05.125
Lord Krishna uses the word

33
00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:07.916
asammudha here – meaning

34
00:02:07.916 --> 00:02:09.708
‘free from confusion.’

35
00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:11.833
This is very significant.

36
00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:13.958
Many people read scripture,

37
00:02:13.958 --> 00:02:16.125
study philosophy,

38
00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:18.000
yet remain in confusion –

39
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:21.208
sometimes believing God is formless,

40
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:23.791
or that the liberated soul itself

41
00:02:23.791 --> 00:02:25.791
becomes God.

42
00:02:25.791 --> 00:02:29.083
But Lord Krishna clearly says –

43
00:02:29.083 --> 00:02:31.875
‘I am the Supreme Person.’

44
00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:33.708
One who accepts this truth

45
00:02:33.708 --> 00:02:35.916
without any confusion

46
00:02:35.916 --> 00:02:39.250
is called asammudha.

47
00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.500
Then He says – bhajati mam

48
00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.166
sarva-bhavena –

49
00:02:43.166 --> 00:02:46.458
‘Such a person worships Me
with complete feeling.’

50
00:02:46.458 --> 00:02:50.166
Not half-heartedly, not merely out of obligation,

51
00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:53.333
but with the whole heart and soul.

52
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:58.208
This is the natural result of
true knowledge – devotion.

53
00:02:58.208 --> 00:03:00.000
When we understand Lord Krishna’s

54
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.791
supreme position,

55
00:03:01.791 --> 00:03:03.500
and also see

56
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.458
how lovingly He guides us from within

57
00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:09.083
and without,

58
00:03:09.083 --> 00:03:14.916
the heart melts and turns toward Him in love.

59
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:18.458
This verse clarifies the key difference
between theoretical

60
00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:22.458
and realised knowledge.

61
00:03:22.458 --> 00:03:25.291
Memorising scripture

62
00:03:25.291 --> 00:03:28.458
or debating is not enough.

63
00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:31.750
If the heart does not bow in devotion, then

64
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.625
real knowledge has not yet arrived.

65
00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:39.166
And an ordinary person –
even without much learning –

66
00:03:39.166 --> 00:03:40.208
but who

67
00:03:40.208 --> 00:03:42.208
firmly knows

68
00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:43.041
that Lord Krishna

69
00:03:43.041 --> 00:03:44.333
is the Purushottama

70
00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:46.791
and serves Him with love –

71
00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:50.541
has grasped the essence of life.

72
00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:52.375
In Chapter 10 too

73
00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:55.041
Lord Krishna had said –

74
00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:59.250
‘Aham sarvasya prabhavo…
iti matvaa bhajante mam’ –

75
00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:02.083
 Buddhā bhāva samanvita āhā

76
00:04:02.083 --> 00:04:05.250
‘I am the source of all.

77
00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:10.541
The wise, knowing this, worship
Me with feeling.’

78
00:04:10.541 --> 00:04:14.208
Here too Lord Krishna repeats the same truth –

79
00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:17.083
bhajati mam sarva-bhavena.

80
00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:18.541
He makes clear

81
00:04:18.541 --> 00:04:22.166
that the fruit of true knowledge is only one –

82
00:04:22.166 --> 00:04:27.083
devotion, meaning loving service.

83
00:04:27.083 --> 00:04:30.416
This verse breaks another misconception –

84
00:04:30.416 --> 00:04:31.875
that on the spiritual path,

85
00:04:31.875 --> 00:04:34.541
emotions must be suppressed.

86
00:04:34.541 --> 00:04:37.458
Lord Krishna says real knowledge

87
00:04:37.458 --> 00:04:40.708
deepens emotions –

88
00:04:40.708 --> 00:04:44.000
but not for the world. For Him –

89
00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:47.041
that is, for Lord Krishna.

90
00:04:47.041 --> 00:04:48.416
Our love,

91
00:04:48.416 --> 00:04:52.333
our surrender, and our aspiration – all

92
00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:56.500
find their true home in Lord Krishna.

93
00:05:01.125 --> 00:05:05.041
You can read many books,

94
00:05:05.041 --> 00:05:07.500
attend many discourses,

95
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:12.416
and say – ‘I know the Gita.’

96
00:05:12.416 --> 00:05:15.041
But true knowledge

97
00:05:15.041 --> 00:05:20.083
is not the name of intellectually understanding –

98
00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:21.250
it is

99
00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:25.083
the name of living as devotion in the heart.

100
00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:29.083
The light of true knowledge shines

101
00:05:29.083 --> 00:05:32.791
when it transforms your thoughts, your words,

102
00:05:32.791 --> 00:05:37.708
and your actions.

103
00:05:37.708 --> 00:05:41.250
If you truly know Me as the Supreme

104
00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:44.250
Person,

105
00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:47.791
your life naturally

106
00:05:47.791 --> 00:05:50.541
begins to turn toward Me.

107
00:05:50.541 --> 00:05:54.250
Then you not only say the right things,

108
00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:57.750
but also do the right things –

109
00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.583
for the right reasons and with the right feeling.

110
00:06:01.583 --> 00:06:05.166
For example, think –

111
00:06:05.166 --> 00:06:08.125
if a parrot is taught:

112
00:06:08.125 --> 00:06:13.000
‘The hunter spreads grain to lay a trap.

113
00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.458
Do not eat his grain.

114
00:06:15.458 --> 00:06:18.875
You will be saved from the trap.’

115
00:06:18.875 --> 00:06:23.750
Does this mean the parrot has truly understood?

116
00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:26.791
Gathering information is easy,

117
00:06:26.791 --> 00:06:30.125
but giving that information the form of life

118
00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:31.541
is difficult.

119
00:06:31.541 --> 00:06:33.041
In Reality,

120
00:06:33.041 --> 00:06:37.041
this is the most beautiful transformation of all.

121
00:06:37.041 --> 00:06:40.375
Do not measure your progress by

122
00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:43.041
how much you have known.

123
00:06:43.041 --> 00:06:46.333
Measure it instead by how

124
00:06:46.333 --> 00:06:50.000
close you are feeling to Me,

125
00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:53.541
and how naturally your actions

126
00:06:53.541 --> 00:06:57.291
are expressing that connection.

127
00:06:57.291 --> 00:07:00.500
When knowledge becomes love,

128
00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:03.750
and love becomes action,

129
00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.333
only then are you

130
00:07:06.333 --> 00:07:10.708
truly walking the path of knowledge.

131
00:07:10.708 --> 00:07:13.916
This is real success.

132
00:07:18.541 --> 00:07:20.708
You may have seen this –

133
00:07:20.708 --> 00:07:24.541
a family member who is withdrawing,

134
00:07:24.541 --> 00:07:26.500
whether in studies,

135
00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.416
in work, or in relationships.

136
00:07:29.416 --> 00:07:34.083
You may think they are lazy or careless.

137
00:07:34.083 --> 00:07:35.583
But do not be hasty

138
00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:38.666
in judging.

139
00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:42.500
I say – look more deeply.

140
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.083
I have said –

141
00:07:44.083 --> 00:07:45.291
one who truly

142
00:07:45.291 --> 00:07:49.083
knows Me worships Me wholeheartedly

143
00:07:49.083 --> 00:07:53.708
and with full surrender.

144
00:07:53.708 --> 00:07:55.958
When understanding is clear,

145
00:07:55.958 --> 00:07:58.833
surrender comes naturally.

146
00:07:58.833 --> 00:08:01.541
A child preparing for an exam

147
00:08:01.541 --> 00:08:04.250
can suddenly become unsettled.

148
00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:07.083
Seeing friends playing and having fun,

149
00:08:07.083 --> 00:08:10.916
they feel – ‘this fun-filled age

150
00:08:10.916 --> 00:08:13.208
is being spent only in studying.’

151
00:08:13.208 --> 00:08:15.916
They become sad.

152
00:08:15.916 --> 00:08:20.833
They need empathy and understanding.

153
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:24.375
Support and guidance given at the right time

154
00:08:24.375 --> 00:08:27.541
brings them back onto the right path.

155
00:08:27.541 --> 00:08:29.208
See, often

156
00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:32.833
the problem is not just laziness.

157
00:08:32.833 --> 00:08:34.666
It arises from confusion, fear,

158
00:08:34.666 --> 00:08:39.083
or inner doubt too.

159
00:08:39.083 --> 00:08:42.833
So instead of only applying pressure,

160
00:08:42.833 --> 00:08:47.083
sit with them, listen to them,

161
00:08:47.083 --> 00:08:51.375
and help clear their doubts.

162
00:08:51.375 --> 00:08:53.916
Remind them

163
00:08:53.916 --> 00:08:56.000
who they truly are

164
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:58.333
and what they can do.

165
00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:01.833
When the intellect is clear, emotions

166
00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:03.458
become steady.

167
00:09:03.458 --> 00:09:06.500
And when emotions are steady,

168
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:10.208
actions flow naturally –

169
00:09:10.208 --> 00:09:15.125
with strength, purpose, and joy.

170
00:09:15.125 --> 00:09:16.333
A family

171
00:09:16.333 --> 00:09:19.666
does not flourish through outer pressure.

172
00:09:19.666 --> 00:09:22.125
A family becomes strong

173
00:09:22.125 --> 00:09:26.583
when inner paths are cleared.

174
00:09:26.583 --> 00:09:30.583
Remind each other of the truth –

175
00:09:30.583 --> 00:09:33.166
then every heart

176
00:09:33.166 --> 00:09:36.375
finds its own way forward.

177
00:09:41.125 --> 00:09:42.666
At the workplace,

178
00:09:42.666 --> 00:09:47.333
when someone is not giving their best,

179
00:09:47.333 --> 00:09:51.666
it is easy to call them indifferent or unmotivated.

180
00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:55.458
But remember – when understanding is clear,

181
00:09:55.458 --> 00:09:56.208
a person

182
00:09:56.208 --> 00:09:59.916
works with their whole heart and purpose.

183
00:09:59.916 --> 00:10:01.666
Where there is confusion,

184
00:10:01.666 --> 00:10:04.416
effort weakens.

185
00:10:04.416 --> 00:10:07.250
But where there is clarity,

186
00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:08.750
energy flows naturally

187
00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.458
and powerfully.

188
00:10:11.458 --> 00:10:15.625
If you see a colleague struggling

189
00:10:15.625 --> 00:10:17.583
or disengaged,

190
00:10:17.583 --> 00:10:21.458
do not simply pile on higher targets.

191
00:10:21.458 --> 00:10:23.833
Take a step back.

192
00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:27.291
Help clear their doubts.

193
00:10:27.291 --> 00:10:31.500
Ask what fears, uncertainties,

194
00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.041
or misunderstandings are holding them back.

195
00:10:34.041 --> 00:10:38.000
When the mind clearly understands
‘why’ something must be done,

196
00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:41.958
and the heart feels safe,

197
00:10:41.958 --> 00:10:44.833
action becomes natural –

198
00:10:44.833 --> 00:10:48.708
strong, focused, and lasting.

199
00:10:48.708 --> 00:10:50.083
True leadership

200
00:10:50.083 --> 00:10:53.458
is not just about getting results.

201
00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:54.500
It is

202
00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:55.958
about removing the fog of confusion

203
00:10:55.958 --> 00:10:59.500
from people’s sight, so that

204
00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.791
they can move forward with their own strength.

205
00:11:02.791 --> 00:11:05.083
When the intellect awakens,

206
00:11:05.083 --> 00:11:07.875
surrender comes on its own.

207
00:11:07.875 --> 00:11:13.000
So do not only increase immediate pressure –

208
00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.250
create clarity.

209
00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:19.875
Only then will you build a team
that moves forward not from fear,

210
00:11:19.875 --> 00:11:25.375
but from deep inner dedication.

211
00:11:25.375 --> 00:11:26.541
Reflect on this.
